WEBVTT

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:07.980
Okay, everyone. 
Have you made a graph of your day?

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.500
Yes.

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:13.410
Sensei, look at mine!

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:16.340
I see you've colored it so it's easy to read.

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:17.960
Good job, Ha-chan!

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.430
Very good.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:22.000
My Day

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:21.200
You've done a fine job.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:38.300
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:57.510
<b>Episode 7:                           Not in My Textbook</b>

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:00.290
Yuuri-san.

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:03.250
Are you thinking about 
our assignment from earlier?

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:05.240
Assignment?

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:07.470
That's not what it's about.

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:11.720
My maid is the only thing I think about all day.

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.170
I just realized it, and now 
I don't know what to do.

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:21.080
Would you please tell me more about that?

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:24.880
I might be able to help
 you with your troubles.

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.160
Okay...

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.330
Well, then...

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:33.810
Ever since Lilith first came to the mansion,

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:36.220
she's made me both curious and suspicious.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.810
I can't take my eyes off her.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:44.370
Every time I think about her, 
my heart races.

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:50.240
My chest gets tight,

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:52.250
and I can't sit stil—

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:57.110
I don't know what to—

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.730
Wait, are you okay?!

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:00.830
Don't mind me.

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:02.620
This happens all the time.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:03.930
All the time?

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.690
That's even more worrying.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:12.220
Well, then, how does she 
seem to you, as a person?

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:15.980
She's just really suspicious.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.850
Suspicious?

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:21.290
She showed up at my mansion one 
day and started working for free.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:24.590
Her sparkling purple eyes are so pretty,

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:27.610
and the way she works so hard is beautiful.

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:31.220
Just being near her makes me happy.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.250
Everything about Lilith is suspicious.

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:39.290
Wh-What's wrong?

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:42.020
That's not really suspicious
 so much as... well...

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:45.070
That's definitely love.

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:48.500
Oh, also!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:52.740
The meals she makes are extra delicious.

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:56.090
And she smells especially nice.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.500
She's way too suspicious!

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.720
It's even more intense 
than in the stories I read.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:09.650
Thank you! Thank you!

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:12.850
Um...

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.180
So what is it that's troubling you?

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:19.080
When Lilith smiles, I feel happy, too.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:23.650
When Lilith looks sad, I feel sad.

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:29.530
When Lilith is talking to someone else,
 I can't contain myself.

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:31.800
Lilith is my maid...

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:33.950
She's so suspicious...

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:36.760
And yet it's like my mind isn't my own.

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.490
I don't get it.

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:44.440
She's so suspicious, 
yet I don't ever want to leave her.

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.500
I'm so confused.

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:51.050
Ever since I met her,
 I've become more and more messed up.

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.100
I might be...

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:56.340
It might be that...

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.520
I'm sick.

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:05.610
Whenever I ask her, 
she just dodges my question.

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:09.110
I think I'm seriously ill,
and she just won't tell me!

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:14.700
Isn't that the nature of your relationship?

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:16.730
What is our relationship?

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:20.990
W-Wait a moment... Have you been 
oblivious this whole time?

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:24.730
I thought this was just humble bragging!

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:25.840
Bragging?

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.290
Never mind...

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:33.720
Anyway, I'm really messed up.
 I can't deal with this.

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:36.040
I don't know what to do.

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:39.360
How do I fix this confusion syndrome?

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:44.110
Even now, it's hard to breathe 
when I think about Lilith.

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.190
If you—

00:05:46.190 --> 00:05:47.090
Yuuri-san.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:51.780
What you're feeling isn't an illness.

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:54.890
I've read about it in a book.

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:57.710
It's more painful and 
agonizing than being sick,

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.620
but you want to treasure it just the same.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:02.470
You're...

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:05.800
in love.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:10.810
Love?

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:18.960
Love...

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:21.940
What is love?

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:27.810
I-I'm home.

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:30.690
Welcome home, young master.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.930
You're home quite late today.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:39.890
You always come home early, 
so I was very lonely.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.290
Just kidding.

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:44.510
<i>H-Huh?</i>

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:46.250
<i>Huh?</i>

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:51.690
<i>I thought we had grown closer recently...</i>

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:54.260
<i>One more try.</i>

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:57.410
The weather is getting cooler.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.650
You don't feel chilled, do you?

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:04.450
Shall I warm you up?

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:05.830
With my bare skin?

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:06.970
Just kidding.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.540
<i>He would normally say...</i>

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:18.990
I wasn't cold at all. Thinking about 
you made my chest feel warm!

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:21.740
<i>...something like that in response.</i>

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:23.830
<i>Why is he so unresponsive?</i>

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:29.890
<i>There have been times when he wasn't 
suspicious of me in the past, but why...</i>

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:32.260
<i>H-He hasn't come to hate me, has he?</i>

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:36.180
<i>N-No, it's too early to assume that.</i>

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.530
<i>Maybe he simply didn't hear me.</i>

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:39.830
<i>That must be it.</i>

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:40.980
<i>Let's try again.</i>

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.020
Young master...

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.910
Will you have dinner?

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:47.530
Or will you have a bath?

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:51.390
Or will you have... me?

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:52.940
Just kidding.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:58.340
<i>That might have been going too far!</i>

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:00.320
Th-That wasn't...

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:01.900
I-I didn't mean anything by it!

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:10.030
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:11.880
Y-Y-Young master!

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:16.100
Are you feeling ill in some way?

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:18.130
Are you hurt? Do you have a fever?

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:20.760
Nothing like that.

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:22.090
What's the matter?

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:23.910
What's the matter?

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:26.320
Well, you...

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.070
<i>...aren't reacting to me.</i>

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:33.900
<i>Wait, that makes it sound 
like I'm some crazy maid!</i>

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:40.910
I-It's just that you seem unwell.

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:45.280
I was just thinking about something.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.730
Sorry to worry you.

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:54.970
No, I apologize for scampering around.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:58.350
By the way, what is it
 you've been thinking about?

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.580
Well...

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:00.170
L...

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:01.700
L?

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:10.470
It's a secret for now.

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.410
You don't understand love?

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:20.060
I tried reading books and stuff,

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:24.370
but there's nothing that 
explains my feelings for Lilith.

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:28.440
In that case, why don't we 
discuss it more at my place?

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:32.310
I'll show you what love is.

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:37.080
Welcome, Yuuri-san.

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:41.070
Thank you for having me.

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:44.890
Please bring some tea 
to the terrace in the yard.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.110
Understood.

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:49.820
Mother, this is my friend from school.

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:52.390
Oh, my. Welcome.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.480
Please make yourself at home.

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:57.600
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:58.210 --> 00:10:01.500
<i>I don't like this kind of atmosphere.</i>

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.340
<i>It reminds me of the past.</i>

00:10:08.510 --> 00:10:09.600
Here.

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.400
Lilith told me to bring this.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:12.460
My!

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:14.080
Financiers!

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.720
Thank you!

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:18.830
I love financiers.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:21.300
I sure can count on your maid.

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:33.490
Why don't we have them together?

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:37.730
Let's eat.

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:41.460
Delicious!

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.440
Lilith made them herself.

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:47.840
So your maid is good at making sweets, too.

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:48.850
Yeah...

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:50.510
She is.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.770
Lilith's cooking is the best in the world.

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:01.510
By the way, couldn't your maid come today?

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:04.350
You should have come together.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:08.050
She brought me part of the way, 
but I sent her home.

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:11.040
Shall we invite her now?

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:13.140
I can have someone fetch her.

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:15.690
Uh... But...

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:26.610
Lilith might decide to leave 
my mansion and work here.

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:33.780
<i>A kind family, lots of servants, 
a large, beautiful mansion...</i>

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:37.730
<i>All the things I lost are abundant here.</i>

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:43.580
She'd make a lot more money 
working for your family.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:47.840
She might be much happier 
here than living with me.

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:50.060
Yuuri-san...

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:52.410
<i>Never mind being in love.</i>

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:59.520
<i>I don't know if I can even
 give her happiness.</i>

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:04.180
I can't imagine your maid
 would think that.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:12.200
She looked very happy being with you.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:16.420
Do you really think so?

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:17.790
Yes.

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:21.470
I see...

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:24.510
I see.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:28.590
What is it?

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:29.980
Oh, nothing.

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:34.260
Anyway, we were talking about 
what love is, weren't we?

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.220
Y-Yeah.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:41.620
In that case, you should read 
my collection of romance novels.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.110
<b>Love Romance</b>

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.110
<b><i>Emerald's First Love</i></b>

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.110
<b><i>Lovesick in Love</i></b>

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.110
<b><i>The Darkness and Light of Passion</i></b>

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:44.190
Young lady...

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.350
You can't take these 
outside without permission.

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:48.410
The master will scold you again.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.780
No!

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:51.170
Just for a bit!

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:53.280
I just need to borrow them for a bit!

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:55.970
Fujisaki!

00:12:57.260 --> 00:13:01.350
<i>I still never figured out what love is.</i>

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:03.250
I'm home.

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:06.360
Welcome home, young master.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.840
What's the matter?

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:20.090
She looked very happy.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.410
It's nothing.

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:32.970
The art contest is coming up.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:36.950
You'll be drawing pieces to submit.

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:40.690
What should we draw?

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:42.040
Anything you'd like.

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:45.170
What's important is that you 
observe what you draw carefully.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:50.770
That way, no matter what you draw, you'll begin to see its true nature.

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:52.150
<i>True nature...</i>

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:53.330
<i>That's it!</i>

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:56.670
You'd like to draw me?

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:01.640
<i>By drawing Lilith,
 I'll expose her true nature.</i>

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:03.650
It's for a school assignment.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:04.980
May I draw you?

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:06.480
Yes, of course.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:10.140
<i>And I might learn about love.</i>

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:15.760
Look at me very carefully 
and draw me thoroughly.

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:17.210
Just kidding.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.200
Got it!

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.330
All right, here I go.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.930
You have...

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:30.020
two moles under your eye,

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.350
and one on your chest.

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:33.970
I see.

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:37.430
What's wrong?

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.640
N-Nothing.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:41.030
I can't draw you if you hide your face.

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:43.910
You were the one who said 
to observe you thoroughly.

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:48.560
That's right! I have to pose!

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:54.550
Wouldn't it be better if you 
drew me taking a proper pose?

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:55.610
That's true.

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:57.190
And my clothes.

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:00.750
If you're going to draw me,
 I should be dressed properly.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.400
I see.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:05.100
H-How would you like me to look?

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:08.220
I'll let you see me how ever you'd like.

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:12.040
How about this kind of pose?

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.380
Or this kind of pose?

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:16.670
I...

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:19.610
want to draw you just as you are.

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:21.720
<i>Just as I am?</i>

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.040
D-Do you mean...

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:24.850
Yeah.

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:27.000
Just as I am...

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:37.030
The way I always am?

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:38.040
Yeah.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:41.600
That's the Lilith I always see.

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:47.600
The way you see me

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:52.450
and the way you think of me
 isn't necessarily who I really am.

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:57.460
I might look completely different 
when you don't see me.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:59.840
R-Really?

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:00.960
That's suspicious.

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:08.190
But no matter how you look, I'll find you.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.820
You're you.

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:16.190
Besides, there's no one as suspicious as you are.

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:26.330
That should do it.

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:28.210
May I take a look?

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:31.450
Oh, you're very good.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:34.090
I never knew you had a talent for art, too.

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:36.620
Young master?

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:37.720
No!

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:39.720
You're much more beautiful than this!

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:42.290
What? I think it looks beautiful.

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:43.350
No, no!

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:46.340
You're a lot more sensual. 
You look nothing like this!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:49.950
I can't express it with my abilities.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:51.690
Young master...

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:54.080
I'm drawing you more.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.530
Don't move, Lilith!

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:58.530
I'll draw until I'm satisfied!

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:10.590
Young master, you have bags under your eyes.

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:13.160
I'm still not done with my drawing.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:13.850
My...

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:17.640
Is it because I'm so beautiful 
that you can't draw me?

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:18.750
Just kidding.

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:19.610
Yeah.

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:25.270
I think I lost sleep thinking about you.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:27.190
Oh, no...

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:29.970
H-How much sleep have you lost?

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.920
I don't know.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:35.610
I was thinking about how to draw 
you the whole time I was in bed.

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:37.440
Before I knew it, it was morning.

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:39.570
Young master...

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:45.950
I'll take responsibility tonight 
and put you to sleep.

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:54.620
How about some healing scents 
to give you a good night's rest?

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:56.660
That does smell nice,

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:59.140
but you smell nicer.

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:02.460
D-Do I?

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:03.590
Um...

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:08.900
In that case, would you like
 to place your head on my lap?

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:12.410
If you like my scent, 
that may help you sleep better.

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:13.300
No.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:16.830
Your legs will go numb.

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:18.540
I'll be too worried to sleep.

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:21.160
I see...

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:23.790
How about some hot milk?

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:29.750
Healing music.

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:34.530
A hot eye-mask.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:42.170
I can't sleep.

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:43.210
Then...

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:46.710
What if I sleep next to you?

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:50.930
Just kidding.

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:55.610
I want to sleep with you.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:59.960
I think I can sleep if you're with me.

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:03.040
B-But I'm a maid...

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:04.470
No?

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.830
Do you think you can fall
 asleep now, young master?

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:15.160
I don't know.

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.910
Why are you at this mansion?

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:25.970
I want to learn more about you.

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:30.760
I think about you so much 
all day that I can't sleep.

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:38.450
But even though you're so close to me now,
 you won't tell me about yourself.

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:41.800
There's so much I don't know 
about you. It scares me.

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:43.570
I'm always worried.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:50.800
It's all right, young master.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:20:00.280
<i>I want to spend the coming</i>

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:06.930
<i>future alongside you</i>

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:02.910
<i>What was this song again?</i>

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:15.250
<i>I search to keep shining</i>

00:20:11.110 --> 00:20:12.600
<i>Oh, yeah...</i>

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:16.600
<i>It's the lullaby my mom used to sing for me.</i>

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:25.950
<i>And walk on down the path</i>

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.930
<i>My mom, and...</i>

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.380
<i>Who was it again?</i>

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:25.680
<i>What was it?</i>

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:34.770
Goodnight.

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:39.260
I slept really well!

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:41.210
Thanks to you, Lilith!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:44.170
Although it was your fault I couldn't sleep.

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:47.140
Good morning. I'm glad to hear that.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.040
What's the matter?

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:54.840
I can't remember what happened
 right before I fell asleep.

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:58.790
I remember feeling really nostalgic, but...

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:00.760
Do you remember, Lilith?

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:01.690
Well...

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:05.400
I wonder.

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.820
There you go, dodging my question again!

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:12.580
It's your fault I couldn't sleep!

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.530
Um...

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:17.220
What if I can't fall asleep again?!

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:23.050
I'm going to have you sleep with me 
again today after I finish the drawing.

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:30.200
B-But then I'll be the one 
who ends up sleep-deprived.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:36.100
A round of applause for Yuuri-kun.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:43.710
<i>The drawing that the young 
master worked so hard on</i>

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:47.070
<i>went on to win an award in the competition.</i>

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:23.910
<b>Next Time
Episode 8: The Girl With the Purple Eyes</b>
